---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const nav = `<strong>Start</strong><a href="/docs">Overview</a><a href="/docs/quickstart">Quickstart</a><strong>Build</strong><a href="/docs/api" class="active">API reference</a><a href="/docs/integrations">SDK &amp; frameworks</a><a href="/docs/multilingual">Multilingual</a><strong>Run</strong><a href="/docs/hosting">Hosting</a><a href="/docs/security">Security</a>`;
---
<Base title="Memflex API reference" desc="Every endpoint: ask, v1 compat, remember, reflexes, activity, metrics, feedback, verify." path="/docs/api">
<div class="wrap" style="padding:64px 24px">
  <span class="eyebrow">Docs · API reference</span>
  <h1>Every endpoint.</h1>
  <div class="docs-grid" style="margin-top:30px">
    <nav class="docs-nav" set:html={nav}></nav>
    <div class="doc">
      <h2>Core</h2>
      <table class="spec">
        <tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Does</th></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /ask</code></td><td>Hit → instant answer; miss → LLM → auto-distilled reflex. Fields: <code>user_id, message, context, llm, serve_threshold, extract_structured, output_schema, explain, ttl_days</code>. Sources: <code>reflex | reflex+reverify | llm</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /v1/chat/completions</code></td><td>OpenAI-compatible. Any framework via <code>base_url</code>; extras <code>reflex_source/confidence/id</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /v1/messages</code></td><td>Anthropic-compatible (Claude SDK via <code>base_url</code>).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /remember</code></td><td>Store a fact: <code>user_id, fact, confidence</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /reflexes</code></td><td>Explicit memorize/upsert (tool-composed answers, imports).</td></tr>
      </table>
      <h2>Inspect &amp; govern</h2>
      <table class="spec">
        <tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Does</th></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /reflexes?user_id=</code></td><td>Active reflexes: confidence, hits, corrections, TTL, provenance.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /activity?limit=&amp;source=</code></td><td>Recent asks newest-first (LLM vs reflex split, latencies).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /metrics</code></td><td><code>hit_rate, avg_latency_ms, llm_calls, cost_saved_30d_inr, calibration[]</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /reflexes/&#123;id&#125;/feedback</code></td><td><code>&#123;"ok": true/false&#125;</code> — tunes confidence live.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>PATCH /reflexes/&#123;id&#125;</code></td><td>Set your own TTL / confidence: <code>&#123;"ttl_days": 2&#125;</code> (1–365, clamped). Console Memory tab has a TTL editor.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>POST /verify/run</code></td><td>Re-check stale memories now.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>DELETE /reflexes/&#123;id&#125;</code></td><td>Erasure (GDPR).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>GET /health</code></td><td>Uptime (always open, even with API key set).</td></tr>
      </table>
      <h2>Auth</h2>
      <p>Set <code>MEMFLEX_API_KEY</code> → every route but <code>/health</code> requires <code>X-API-Key</code> (or <code>Authorization: Bearer</code>). Empty = open local mode.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Base>
